<title>UK: British police find dead stowaway in plane.</title>
<headline>British police find dead stowaway in plane.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ground staff at Gatwick Airport near London on Sunday found the body of a boy in the wheel compartment of a passenger plane just arrived from Nairobi.</p>
<p>British Airways said they had begun an inquiry into how the boy, described by police as &quot;of African appearance&quot;, had apparently managed to stow away in the Boeing 747.</p>
<p>Police Inspector Peter Cooper said: &quot;This was a tragic loss of a young life and one can only guess at what spurred him into doing something so dangerous.&quot;</p>
</text>
